WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:08.220
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:14.730
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.560
It's my day!

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.140
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.550
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.920
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.330
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.100
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.240
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.750
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.890
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.950
I just want to walk

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.490
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.460
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:35.370
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.810
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.080
It's my day!

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:54.630
If you think you can compete with me,
with your looks...

00:01:56.990 --> 00:01:58.390
...you're delusional.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:06.500
<i>It's weird!</i>

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.350
<i>All that from sweet,
refined Sakurako...</i>

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.910
<i>...the little girl
who's afraid of men?</i>

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:17.240
<i>I just don't get it!</i>

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:19.920
<i>It's making me nuts!</i>

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:31.660
"Get Lost!!"

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:41.270
<i>She's changed a lot
since elementary school.</i>

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:45.200
<i>You knew Sakurako, Makiko?</i>

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.950
<i>I've only got vague memories, but...</i>

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:52.810
<i>I think she was more cheerful 
and energetic as a child.</i>

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:03.690
<i>I guess Makiko was right!</i>

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:10.830
<i>Still...</i>

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:15.080
<i>Why would she lie about
being afraid of men?</i>

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:16.300
Makino!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.510
Oh, it's you, Sakurako.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:26.730
Makino, are you okay?
You don't look so good.

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.850
N-no, it's nothing.

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:33.420
Maybe it's all that hard partying
out at HD Planet?

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:35.990
Your hips are still workin' it!

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:43.060
Mimasaka... what is H... D... Planet?

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:44.600
<i>No way!</i>

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:47.900
A club. A nightclub.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.900
You've never heard of HD Planet?

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.200
Oh, Sakurako, you're so unspoiled!

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:59.080
<i>How can she lie like that?!
What about last night?</i>

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.210
What's the matter, Domyoji?

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:05.920
You haven't said a thing
to your girlfriend today...

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:11.820
Did you two have an argument?

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:17.460
Sakurako, let him be.
He's been in a bad mood.

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:20.720
Huh? Did something 
bad happen, Domyoji?

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:23.900
Shut up! Quit nosing 
around in my business.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.420
Besides, what's she doing
hovering around us?

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:33.180
Sojiro, Akira...
you're both drooling over her.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.920
You're setting an awful example.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.650
I... I didn't mean...

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:44.790
Makino!

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.390
Tsukasa, that was too far.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:00.070
<i>Sakurako...</i>

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:04.810
<i>Always charming... without fail...</i>

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:09.480
<i>There must be a reason.</i>

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:16.580
<i>I hid my true self when
I first came to school here.</i>

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:23.480
<i>Even Domyoji, who can be
an idiot with a short fuse...</i>

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:25.560
<i>...has a kind and refined
side to him.</i>

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:30.730
<i>Perhaps every person 
really does have two sides.</i>

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:35.640
<i>If I'm her friend, maybe I should just try
to be more understanding...</i>

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:40.570
Girls all think that
if they cry, they win.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:43.120
Hey!

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:49.590
She didn't just cry.
You made her cry!

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:54.090
Guys who make girls cry
are trash! Scum!

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:54.750
Trash?

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.190
Did you just call me trash?

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.730
Yup... if not trash, garbage!

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:02.480
Garbage?!

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:06.480
No, worse... You're a teensy scrap
nobody bothers to pick up!

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:08.700
I'm... teensy?

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:13.940
Makino, that's so mean!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.710
How could you say such a thing?

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:21.710
He's the leader
of Eitoku Academy!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:27.320
If you insult Domyoji,
I'll never forgive you!

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:29.990
<i>W-what?</i>

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.190
<i>But I was defending you!</i>

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:36.430
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:51.010
<i>One thing I know for sure...</i>

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.890
Sakurako, you have a 
crush on Domyoji, don't you?

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.400
Yes, I love him!

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:03.590
I know I shouldn't...

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:07.410
I know he's yours.

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:08.910
But I love him!

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:14.030
Makino, are you really
going out with Domyoji?

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:17.330
You aren't, are you?

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:20.540
Tell me the truth! For me!

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.490
No, we're not going out.

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:55.800
Tsuki! You're really 
not going to G Night?

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:57.270
Nope... sorry.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:00.940
You might see that
foreign hottie again.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.320
<i>Please... don't remind me.</i>

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:10.620
Bye-bye, then!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.620
Are you sure you don't
want to go?

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:16.890
Yup. It's way more fun
being with you, Makiko.

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:18.390
Tsukushi...

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:22.680
<i>It's nice... to spend time
with a good friend...</i>

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.350
<i>that I can be open with.</i>

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:27.140
Want to grab a snack somewhere?

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:28.170
Okay.

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:42.650
Look! Someone posted
a nasty picture there.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.590
Wow, with a foreigner, too!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:45.920
That's so <i>wrong!</i>

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:49.140
Hey... That's Tsukushi Makino!

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.990
Be careful, Tsukushi.

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:08.990
Makiko?

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:16.780
"Be careful"?

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:18.950
Did you see it?

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:22.120
Yeah, I couldn't believe it!
How could she?

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.930
<i>What's going on?
Something's not right.</i>

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:33.670
Good morning!

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:37.900
First period is gym.

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:39.090
Oh, right.

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:40.010
Let's go.

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:48.980
All right, get into groups of
two and practice passing.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.250
Hey, Makiko, let's team up.

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:55.020
Tsuki... let's work on our passes.

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:56.490
With me.

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:57.380
C'mon, Tsuki.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.220
Well, um... I can't pass with
all of you at once.

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:01.160
Huh?!

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:20.280
Sorry, Tsuki.

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:21.510
She's so dumb.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:23.880
It's because she spaced out.

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:25.980
<i>Tsukushi...</i>

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.230
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:45.130
<i>All of a sudden,
everyone's attitude changed.</i>

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.560
<i>Just what happened?</i>

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:03.150
<i>No!</i>

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:33.850
<i>This is so mean... so vicious!</i>

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.190
<i>What's going on?
Everything's so weird!</i>

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:49.310
Hey, you! Give me back
my nail polish!

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.730
Huh? Oh... It's in my desk.

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:04.810
Here.

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:11.180
You <i>actually</i> thought this
would look good on you?!

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:14.990
Keep dreaming.

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:26.630
<i>I've got a bad feeling about this...</i>

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:51.590
<i>W-what's this?</i>

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:55.620
I saw the bulletin board.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:56.760
<i>Bulletin board?</i>

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:58.830
Your underwear's pretty tacky.

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:02.300
A foreigner, huh?

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.270
You sure get around, don't you?

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:07.770
<i>It can't be...</i>

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:13.940
<i>No way!</i>

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:44.110
<i>How could this photo...?</i>

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:47.710
<i>Why?!</i>

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.060
She must think we're idiots!

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:09.830
Acting like she was
Domyoji's girlfriend!

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:14.630
It'll be fun playing games
with her now.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.980
<i>How did this happen?!</i>

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:40.530
<i>To do something so mean...</i>

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:43.930
<i>I know I brought this on myself.</i>

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.900
<i>But why would he do it?</i>

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:54.710
<i>It's too cruel.</i>

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:03.750
<i>It's unforgivable!</i>

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:15.630
Tsukushi? What's the matter?

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:17.130
I'm sorry to drop in so late.

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:20.300
No problem. I'm glad you came.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.540
I need to talk to Thomas.

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:24.370
You have a visitor?

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:27.910
Yes, Grandmother, a friend from school.

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:30.910
Oh, dear... and it's pouring rain.

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:33.410
Invie her in, Sakurako.

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:38.220
I'll go and call Thomas.
And I'll get some tea.

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:40.920
N-no thank you, Sakurako.
Please don't.

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:50.760
<i>I couldn't sip a drop of tea...
at a time like this.</i>

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:55.580
Sakurako...

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:59.250
Oh Grandmother,
I've made the tea already.

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:00.940
You don't have to
stay up for us.

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:02.340
It's not that.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.940
I'm just worried about you.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:06.940
Grandmother!

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:11.650
There's nothing to worry about.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:16.320
I'm having fun every day, 
and I'm very happy.

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:18.720
Sakurako...

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:25.300
Tsukushi, what's wrong?
You came to see me?!

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:28.300
You jerk!

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:29.870
Huh?

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.390
How could you take this photo...

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:34.380
...and then post it on
the school bulletin board?!

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:35.370
What were you thinking?!

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:37.510
C-Calm down, Tsukushi.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:39.380
What photo?

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:40.980
Stop feigning innocence!

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:43.680
Why would you do
such a horrible thing?!

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:49.350
Err... well...
It was just a memento of us...

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.320
<i>Wait a minute...
How did we both get in the photo?</i>

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:58.360
<i>If we were actually alone,
who took the picture?</i>

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.400
Who took this photo?!

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:09.910
Who else was in that room
besides us that night?!

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:18.780
We didn't do anything!
Isn't that right?!

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:22.520
Answer me!

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:29.690
Well...

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:32.360
Believe me, it wasn't my idea.

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:34.200
But Sakurako...

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.450
I brought you tea, Makino.

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:53.850
Drink it while it's hot.

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:58.020
Sakurako... why?

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:05.030
What were you thinking?

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.500
I thought we were friends!

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.680
Makino, you saw me
the other night, didn't you?

00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:14.000
At HD Planet.

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:21.140
I'm beautiful! And men
eat it up with a spoon.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:24.140
Ugly women shouldn't
be allowed to live.

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:25.950
The world doesn't want them.

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:29.150
I can't possibly let someone
with your average looks...

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.660
...get fawned over by the F4.

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:32.590
<i>Sakurako...</i>

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:36.190
Friends? With you?
Don't make me laugh.

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:41.160
I don't need friends!

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:45.550
From the time I entered
this school...

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:48.270
...I've wanted nothing more
than revenge on the F4.

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:52.970
I want them to grovel at my feet!

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:54.750
<i>Revenge on the F4?</i>

00:18:56.010 --> 00:19:00.850
So, Makino, I took
full advantage of you.

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:04.780
But I don't need you anymore!
Just get lost, you ugly waste!

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:13.780
Don't just stand there staring.

00:19:13.780 --> 00:19:16.060
You should get home 
and worry aobut yourself.

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:20.140
I'm sure you can figure out
what starts tomorrow, can't you?

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:24.180
Your days at Eitoku are over, Makino.

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:29.040
Until now, the F4 and Shizuka Todo
watched out for you.

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:34.510
By the way, isn't 
Shizuka Todo so dumb?

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:37.480
Throwing away a brilliant future.

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:40.250
I'm appalled. She was so stupid.

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:44.690
Stop right there, or
I'll beat your cute face to a pulp.

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:48.200
You have no right
to speak about her!

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:51.860
Shizuka was like an angel...

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:55.200
...with a beautiful heart
to match her beautiful face.

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:59.210
I thought you were
like that, too!

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:02.890
You might've called me
an "ugly waste"...

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:04.930
...but take a good look
at yourself in the mirror...

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:07.540
...and you'll see how twisted
and deformed you are!

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:09.310
Deformed?!

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:11.060
Me?

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:17.560
Makino... do you realize
what you just said?

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:20.980
Tomorrow, you'll come crawling...

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:23.070
...to beg me for forgiveness.

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:24.070
You're nuts!

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:27.860
I'll never beg anyone
for anything!

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:31.340
I'd rather die than do 
something so humiliating!

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:35.570
And you can mark my words!

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:43.310
You can talk tough for tonight.
We'll see how long it lasts.

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:48.250
Sakurako... you went too far on this.

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:49.890
That woman...

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:54.890
She called me ugly.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:04.000
I'll never forgive her... or the F4!

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:12.740
<i>What'll you do, Tsukushi?</i>

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:16.150
<i>You said a mouthful.
But you can still back out.</i>

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.210
<i>Who cares if I quit Eitoku?</i>

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:20.460
<i>But...</i>

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:24.550
<i>It's a declaration of war!</i>

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:29.860
<i>I've already handled so much...</i>

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:33.810
<i>If I was going to give up anyway,</i>

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:35.600
<i>I shouldn't have bothered
at the start.</i>

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:38.400
<i>I won't run.</i>

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:41.200
<i>I'm Tsukushi the Weed!</i>

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:45.280
<i>I'm resistant to all pesticides!
I'll show them what I'm made of!</i>

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:11.200
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.170 --> 00:22:19.070
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:20.840 --> 00:22:28.950
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:36.990
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:44.760
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:52.900
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:52.900
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:52.900 --> 00:23:01.280
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:52.900 --> 00:23:01.280
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:11.060
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.060 --> 00:23:18.830
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.100 --> 00:23:27.000
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.100 --> 00:23:27.000
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

