I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:35.410
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:46.990 --> 00:23:48.860
I so looked forward
to going to school...

00:23:48.930 --> 00:23:50.860
Surrounded by lots of friends...

00:23:51.090 --> 00:23:55.330
Chatting and joking together,
maybe even arguing.

00:23:55.770 --> 00:23:58.200
Is wanting to be happy
every day...

00:23:58.270 --> 00:23:59.600
...just a fleeting dream?

00:24:00.240 --> 00:24:02.570
Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"Please Believe Me!"

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:05.910
I don't care if no one else
believes me...

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:07.840
...as long as you do.
